  "title": "TotalEnergies confirms the second interim dividend of €0.85/share for fiscal year 2025, an increase of 7.6% compared to 2024",
  "summary": "Paris, 24th July 2025 – The Board of Directors meeting on July 23, 2025 under the chairmanship of Mr. Patrick Pouyanné, Chairman and Chief Executive Officer, decided the distribution of a second interim dividend of 0.85 €/share for fiscal year 2025, an increase of 7.6% compared to the three interim dividends paid for fiscal year 2024 […]",
